{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Japan Expo Paris 2023」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46にとって初の海外でのライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お客さん見に来てくださるかなー？と少し不安な部分もあったのですが、会場に来てくださったたくさんの方の声援のおかげで最高のライブとなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本からフランスに来て下さった方、フランスやその他の国から来て下さった方、世界中のBuddiesに会うことができて幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddiesだけでなく櫻坂を初めて知るお客さんにもライブを見ていただけたこと、本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが進むにつれて、お客さんの声援も大きくなっていくのが分かりテンションが上がりました。\n嬉しかったなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素敵な経験となったライブでした。\nいろんな場所でライブができるよう、たくさんのBuddiesに会いに行けるよう、これからも力をつけていきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリを満喫することが出来たよーの写真たち〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ15CMRXH411F56S1QZE16B0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エッフェル塔〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ15CNRCGZ4V8VGYTX7YWNN8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凱旋門〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ15CPTSDBBGHC67DNDWRQCJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレな街でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ15CQV86E7FPPHYJMKHD2CR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスパンの持ち方合ってる？\nおいしかったなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ15CRTE5J1NB6HMNQWDDN53","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ15CSWDZC2FZSVTPWZ3FS55","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブを終わった直後の2枚〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また載せますねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"}